          "text": "a_c=−v²/r=−(1.2 m/s)²/0.06 m=−1.44/0.06 m/s²=−24 m/s² (Answer). The centripetal force on the bug is F_c=ma_c; using the magnitude, F_c=0.005 kg×24 m/s²=0.12 N (Answer).",
