          "text": "Newton’s law shows g depends on masses of all reacting bodies and their separation. For object mass m₀ on Earth, Earth mass mₑ, centre distance rₑ: Fg=Gm₀mₑ/rₑ² (1). Weight Fg=W=m₀g (2). Comparing gives g=Gmₑ/rₑ² (equation 5.4). With mₑ=6×10²⁴ kg, rₑ=6.4×10⁶ m and G=6.67×10⁻¹¹ N·m²·kg⁻²: g=9.77 m/s²≈9.8 m/s².",
